{"repositoryId":1232783522,"availability":"available","full":"Cobos-Bioinfo/Euka-Survey","name":"Euka-Survey","description":"Fast Streamlit app for exploring genome assemblies, annotations, and RNA-seq resources across the Eukaryotic Tree of Life using a precomputed SQLite database optimized for instant taxonomic queries and comparative genomics.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-08T09:09:46Z","updated":"2026-10-18T08:20:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://euka-survey.streamlit.app/","topics":["biodiversity","bioinformatics","comparative-genomics","sqlite","sqlite-database","streamlit","streamlit-webapp"],"demo":"https://euka-survey.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:13.209Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:13.209Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:13.209Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:13.209Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A genomic resource explorer for the eukaryotic tree of life.","EukaSurvey is a Streamlit web app that lets you see, at a glance, which clades of eukaryotes have what kinds of genomic data publicly available: genome assemblies (NCBI), functional annotations (Annotrieve), and RNA-seq runs (ENA), split into short-read and long-read.","The data is precomputed weekly into a SQLite database (eukaryotes.db, 400 MB) that the app downloads on first launch."],"features":["Pick a clade — choose a Root taxon in the sidebar (a built-in","Break it down — in Explore Results, choose a breakdown rank","Visualize two ways — one click generates two synced views of the","a 🌳 phylogenetic tree with per-group divergent bar charts","a sortable 📊 table (downloadable as TSV)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Cobos-Bioinfo/Euka-Survey/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4f35bd5d347b6f94a2c6bf51e1f83763def251a82f13b9d9914bdb5b6c31fabf","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49